Value Filldown slot (\d+)
Value Required memory_total_kb (\d+)
Value memory_used_kb (\d+)
Value memory_free_kb (\d+)
Value memory_shared_kb (\d+)
Value memory_buffers_kb (\d+)
Value memory_cached_kb (\d+)
Value memory_free_percent ([\d.]+)

Start
  ^Slot ${slot}:
  ^Mem:\s+${memory_total_kb}\s+${memory_used_kb}\s+${memory_free_kb}\s+${memory_shared_kb}\s+${memory_buffers_kb}\s+${memory_cached_kb}\s+${memory_free_percent}% -> Record

EOF
